      "writtenOn": "2025-08-25T12:07:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My interpretation of https://b.corp.google.com/issues/383656687#comment8 is if host(EC) change global system configuration, then PDC will issue a reset on both port itself and we will receive an interrupt with pdc_pd_status.error_recovery_details \u003d\u003d 0x23 to indicate the completion.\n\nIn my test, we only receive this interrupt until we plun in a dongle or a charger.",
